  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening SDG Localization Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Despite the success of SDG-L 1.0 implementation and on-going effective interventions under SDG-L 1.5, several gaps (e.g. income disparity, climate challenges, gender inequality) remain. The proposed project Strengthening Sustainable Development Goal (SDG) Localization in Thailand &#x2013; Phase II (SDG-L 2.0) aims to advance the effective implementation of SDGs in Thailand, with particular emphasis on human rights, gender equality, environmental sustainability, and climate change adaptation and resilie</narrative>
  </description>
